      "created_at": "2015-03-10T21:40:15.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Another issue I remember coming up with this card was \"Do you get to draw twice in your Draw phase because you haven't played a card or used a power yet?\". I don't recall there being a specific conclusion reached as to whether or not you can, but when it came up in the game I played against the Wager Master, we just drew once.</p>",
