      "created_at": "2015-03-12T12:20:58.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Yeah, I can see the reasoning for drawing once and for drawing twice. It'd be nice to have an official definition, though :).</p>\n<p>Another thing I'm not sure on is that card of Guise's where he pinches someone else's stuff (haven't actually played Guise since getting him so far, been busy getting our arses kicked by most of the new villains and wanted to save him till we're up against someone whose deck I know better ;)), and the wording of the card implies the other person can still use it (it only says it affects <span class=\"bbcode-i\">Guise</span> as though it was his, it doesn't say it affects the original owner that way as well :P) but the official clarification says they can't. I'm still not sure which way I'm gonna go on that one when it comes up in-game…</p>",
